* USE DEVOTAG ALIAS DEVOTAG

* SELECT DEVOTIONS
* SET RELATION TO DOCID INTO DEVOSCRIPT
* SET RELATION TO DOCID INTO DEVOTAG ADDITIVE

* RELATIONS
* TUPVALIDATE

